   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "From 70 to 100",
     "texto": [
      "In standard French, as spoken in France, **70–79** are formed with **soixante + 10–19**. For **71** you use **et**: **soixante et onze**; for **73**: **soixante-treize**.",
      "**80** is said **quatre-vingts** with a final **s** when it stands alone. From **81** to **89** you use **quatre-vingt + 1–9**, without that **s**: **quatre-vingt-un**.",
      "From **90** to **99** you use **quatre-vingt + 10–19**: **91**, **quatre-vingt-onze**; **99**, **quatre-vingt-dix-neuf**.",
      "**100** is **cent**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
