    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the shop",
     "texto": [
      "You ask the price with **coûter**: **Cette robe coûte combien ?** In the plural: **Ces chaussures coûtent combien ?**",
      "**Trop** before an adjective means «too»: **trop cher** (too expensive), **trop petit**.",
      "**Je peux essayer ?** = can I try it on?",
      "To decide: **Je le prends** (I'll take it, masculine) or **Je la prends** (I'll take it, feminine).",
      "To pay: **par carte** (by card) or **en espèces** (in cash)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
